  "description": "Passwordless login and authentication for ASP.NET Core: an OpenID Connect (OIDC) provider built on OpenIddict, with login through Telegram, WhatsApp, Instagram, Messenger, WeChat, Viber, MAX or email, and approval of sensitive actions. On a computer, TV or kiosk, your users scan a QR code shown by your website or app; on a phone, they tap a button. Either way, they confirm with one tap in a messaging app they already have.",
